":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object. Pass the file’s URL into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:URL:options:"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer and add the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shape source to the map using the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:"},{"type":"text","text":" method. The URL may"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be a local file URL, an HTTP URL, or an HTTPS URL."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you’ve added the GeoJSON file to the map via an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},{"type":"text","text":" object,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can configure the appearance of its data and control what data is visible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" objects. You can also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"#Extracting-GeoJSON-data-from-the-map"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Converting-GeoJSON-data-into-shape-objects","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Converting GeoJSON data into shape objects"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have GeoJSON data in the form of source code (also known as “GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text”), you can convert it into an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swi